  "title": "Duke Energy announces proposed offering of $1 billion of convertible senior notes due 2029",
  "summary": "Duke Energy Corporation (NYSE: DUK) today announced that it intends to offer, subject to market and other conditions, $1 billion aggregate principal amount of convertible senior notes due 2029 (the “convertible notes”) in a private placement under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the “Securities Act”).",
